          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Hardware-compressed payload this texture uploads instead of a pixel source, or null for the ordinary case. Mutually exclusive with source and pixels: installing one clears the others, so a texture is never ambiguous about what it uploads. A handle that arrives empty from the loader can become either, which is what lets an asset variant swap a PNG for a KTX2 file without changing what a caller holds."
        },
